{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51004","headline":"题失 · 许坚","name":"题失","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"只应天上路，不爲下方开。\n道既学不得，仙从何处来。\n（〖1〗按此诗见宋郑文宝撰《江南余载》卷下，《知不足斋丛书》本。\n《全唐诗》卷七百五十七收许坚诗五首，又卷八百六十一仙卷亦收五首幷句，其中两句曰「道既学不得，仙从何处来」。\n即此诗之後两句，盖《全唐诗》缺其前半。\n〖2〗《江南余载》：许坚往来句曲庐阜之间，草装布囊，或卧於野，或和衣浴涧中，萧然不接人事，独笑独吟而已〖余畧〗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}